    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dooley Auctioneers are delighted to present No. 3 The Dale to the market, a beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached family home extending to approximately 93 sq. m. (1,001 sq. ft.), superbly positioned within the highly regarded Brookwood development on Herbert Road, Bray.\r\n\r\nOccupying a prime position overlooking a large central amenity green, this bright and spacious family home offers well-balanced accommodation together with a private south-westerly facing rear garden, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, growing families and those seeking a home in one of Bray's most convenient residential locations.\r\n\r\nThe well-appointed accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with guest WC, a generous front-facing living room featuring a coal-effect gas fireplace and pleasant views over the landscaped communal green. Double doors lead through to the dining room, creating an excellent flow for both everyday living and entertaining. Sliding patio doors provide direct access to the sunny rear garden, while the adjoining kitchen is fitted with an excellent range of floor and wall units, offering ample storage and workspace.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, all benefiting from built-in wardrobes. The spacious principal bedroom enjoys the added benefit of an en-suite shower room, while a well-appointed family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe property also offers excellent potential for a substantial attic conversion, subject to the necessary planning permission, with many neighbouring homes having successfully completed similar conversions.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys off-street parking to the front together with a neatly maintained front garden. The private rear garden benefits from a highly desirable south-westerly orientation, ensuring sunshine throughout the afternoon and evening, and provides an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing. Mature planting and colourful flower beds further enhance this attractive outdoor space.\r\n\r\nBrookwood is one of Bray's most established and sought-after residential developments. The Dale is a quiet cul-de-sac comprising just twenty semi-detached and detached family homes surrounding a beautifully maintained central green. Ideally situated just off Herbert Road, residents enjoy easy access to Bray Town Centre, an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, local shops, cafés, sporting facilities, Bray Seafront, the DART Station and Dublin Bus services. The nearby N11 and M50 provide excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nOffering spacious accommodation, a superb family-friendly setting and an exceptional location, No. 3 The Dale represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a quality home in the heart of Bray.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property benefits from a neatly maintained garden together with off-street parking. Purpose-built shallow steps provide easy access to the entrance.\r\n\r\nThe private south-westerly facing rear garden enjoys sunshine throughout the afternoon and evening, creating the perfect space for outdoor entertaining and al fresco dining. Mature planting and colourful flower beds provide year-round interest while enhancing the privacy of this attractive outdoor setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway- 4.51m x 1.71m\r\nBright and welcoming entrance hallway with access to the principal accommodation and guest WC.\r\n\r\nGuest WC- 1.57m x 0.78m\r\nComprising WC and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nLiving Room-5.12m x 3.45m\r\nSpacious front-facing reception room overlooking the large communal green, featuring a coal-effect gas fireplace and double doors leading to the dining room.\r\n\r\nDining Room-3.35m x 3.01m\r\nBright dining area with sliding patio doors opening onto the private rear garden and open-plan access to the kitchen.\r\n\r\nKitchen- 5.54m x 2.31m\r\nWell-appointed fitted kitchen with an excellent range of floor and wall units, generous worktop space and ample storage.\r\n\r\nLanding- 2.44m x 1.31m\r\nProviding access to all first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nPrincipal Bedroom-3.50m x 3.38m\r\nSpacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and en-suite shower room.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite-1.75m x 1.35m\r\nComprising shower, wash hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2- 3.21m x 2.73m\r\nGenerous double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3- 3.23m x 2.52m\r\nWell-proportioned bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom- 1.94m x 1.75m\r\nComprising bath, wash hand basin and WC."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Three-bedroom semi-detached family home\r\nPrime position overlooking a large amenity green\r\nPrivate south-westerly facing rear garden\r\nDouble glazed windows throughout\r\nExcellent potential for attic conversion (subject to planning permission)\r\nWalking distance to Bray Town Centre\r\nClose to schools, shops and local amenities\r\nEasy access to Bray DART Station and Dublin Bus services\r\nConvenient access to the N11 and M50 road network\r\nQuiet cul-de-sac of just twenty homes"
      },
